The local use is properly fenced. The generality of the imported Galois-stability lemma is an out-of-slice interface.

#### C4. Residual separability is stated where consumed

> “each irreducible factor r2 of a separable level-2 residual gives ONE irreducible factor”

> “whenever r is a SIMPLE factor of a separable R_kappa”

