This is factorization in the abstract finite residue field. It does not use \(2^{-1}\), a quadratic discriminant-square criterion, or mod-\(4/8\) arithmetic.

#### C6. The parity discussion explicitly rejects a characteristic-specific shortcut

> “decide RAM by the SLOPE's denominator, which is translation-invariant. A reader using f-level pin parity is wrong”

